                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6067bd2f-41df-33bf-8c37-6ed458995702",
                        "entry_id": "4ea202cd-e37f-3117-8705-da83da8127bb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "мед. физическое повреждение органов тела, вызванное разницей давлений между внешней средой (газ или жидкость) и внутренними полостями"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9044fd4-f153-4cde-bcff-7b3e17859f33",
                                "sense_id": "6067bd2f-41df-33bf-8c37-6ed458995702",
                                "text": "Баротравма лёгких, именуемая иначе лжекессонной или кессонноподобной болезнью, может также носить название травматической газовой эмболии."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d5db1595-a739-45de-8caf-85279960b14a",
                                "sense_id": "6067bd2f-41df-33bf-8c37-6ed458995702",
                                "text": "Объективные симптомы баротравмы уха зависят от степени полученной травмы."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e7f7a889-a099-42a7-8341-3bd818b2d5f1",
                        "source_entry_id": "4ea202cd-e37f-3117-8705-da83da8127bb",
                        "source_sense_id": "6067bd2f-41df-33bf-8c37-6ed458995702",
                        "target_lang_word": "barotrauma",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "barotrauma",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "12b801e0-f153-37b2-811d-537b46c352eb",
                                        "entry_id": "5e17db74-1195-39fe-844e-9b03b4c3a38a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Damage to body tissue caused by a difference in pressure between an air space in or near the body and the surrounding air."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b1a786d-466f-40b3-bbaa-ab78234f6ebf",
                                                "sense_id": "12b801e0-f153-37b2-811d-537b46c352eb",
                                                "text": "Of course, one must take care not to inadvertently seal the ear canal with the suction tip, thereby risking \"tympanic membrane barotrauma\" and possibly sucking out the patient's brains."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13193c68-76b2-4790-855a-23b90a1b89b2",
                                                "sense_id": "12b801e0-f153-37b2-811d-537b46c352eb",
                                                "text": "The timing raised suspicions that the whales had been disoriented by \"barotrauma,\" or pressure injuries to sensitive ear and brain tissues caused by sound waves."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
